+# Vercel AI SDK runtime guidance
+
+`/src/support-agent.ts` passes an object produced by `buildRequest` to `generateText`. Because `prepareStep` may replace instructions, static inspection does not establish which instructions are effective at runtime. Preserve the current wrapper unless this boundary is deliberately migrated, and require focused runtime coverage for any change to instruction delivery.
